<title>UK: SUN Brewing completes Povolzhe acquisition.</title>
<headline>SUN Brewing completes Povolzhe acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's SUN Brewing said on Thursday it had completed its acquisition of a 75 percent stake in AO Povolzhe, which owns a brewery in Volgagrad oblast.</p>
<p>A 1.46 million share issue by SUN to fund the purchase will be put to an extraordinary general meeting on March 17 for formal approval.</p>
<p>SUN also said in a statement that it had an agreement with the European Bank for Reconstruction and Development's Lower Volga Region Fund and Hancock Venture Partners Inc for them to to invest almost $3.2 million in a capital expenditure programme at the Povolzhe brewery.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770 (fax +44 171 583 7239)</p>
